    "created_at": "2018-12-20T19:55:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-12-20T19:55:44Z",
    "body": "> Tie this to the [navigator compatibility mode](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/system-state.html#concept-navigator-compatibility-mode), and require it for the Gecko value (IMO less good, given it preserves inconsistencies between browsers)\r\n\r\nThis would also work generally for the `-webkit-` prefixed things that we don't have strong evidence for needing in Gecko, e.g. webkit prefixed fullscreen.",
