    "created_at": "2018-12-20T20:29:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-12-20T20:29:32Z",
    "body": "I have a very strong preference of avoiding things forking based on that unless we absolutely have to (i.e., mutual incompatibility being a requirement of the platform); I'd much rather have browsers be interoperable unless we absolutely cannot avoid it.",
